# StudyPilot AI - Environment Configuration
# Team Codex, Sanjay Ghodawat University

# Google Gemini API Key (Server-Side Environment Variable)
# Configure this in your Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables
# or locally in a .env.local file (never commit your live key to Git)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Web Search Fallback
# When a student asks a question NOT found in their uploaded PDF, StudyPilot AI
# automatically performs a web search using Gemini's built-in Google Search grounding.
# No additional API key is required — this reuses the GEMINI_API_KEY above.
